description:
Spell text with the ICAO/NATO radiotelephony alphabet (Alfa, Bravo, Charlie...), with ICAO number words (Tree, Fower, Fife, Niner) or plain ones, optional Capital/Lowercase markers for passwords, or decode code words back to text. Same rules as redbison.dev/nato-phonetic-alphabet.

Returns: Text: code words, ' / ' between input words. structuredContent { spelled, tokens[{char, word, pronunciation}] } or, for decode, { text, unknown[] }.
Example input: {"text":"Gate B12","direction":"spell","spelling":"icao","digits":"icao","markCase":false}
